# Contracts

One section per program; read the section of the program that owns your ticket. Every attachment of every program is below.

## HOS — applies when your ticket belongs to HOS

### Contracts

Contract first: edit the module's `HOSPACK/HOS/<MODULE>/spec/openapi/*.yaml` through the pack, regenerate (`make codegen` / `pnpm codegen`), then implement. One `Problem` shape, `bearer` scheme, one `/v1/<area>` per gateway, ports from PORTS.md.

